{"id":130,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"着実・勤勉・自主を軸に自律を育てる","feature_description":"校訓「着実・勤勉・自主」のもと、心身ともに健全で自律的な努力を続ける人を育てます。中学校は週6日授業で学習時間を確保し、土曜日や放課後、長期休業も学習機会とします。部活動や行事などの体験型活動では主体的に取り組む機会を設け、学習内容や生徒の実態に応じてカリキュラムを柔軟に運用し、中学段階から大学進学を見据えた基礎学力を積み上げます。","clubs":[{"id":2005,"name":"英語研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.johokusaitama.ac.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026_pamphlet_m-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2007,"name":"釣り部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.johokusaitama.ac.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026_pamphlet_m-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2008,"name":"物理部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.johokusaitama.ac.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026_pamphlet_m-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2012,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.johokusaitama.ac.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026_pamphlet_m-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2013,"name":"地歴部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.johokusaitama.ac.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026_pamphlet_m-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2015,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.johokusaitama.ac.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026_pamphlet_m-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2017,"name":"鉄道研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.johokusaitama.ac.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026_pamphlet_m-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2018,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.johokusaitama.ac.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026_pamphlet_m-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2020,"name":"生物部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.johokusaitama.ac.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026_pamphlet_m-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2021,"name":"模型部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.johokusaitama.ac.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026_pamphlet_m-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2022,"name":"化学部","category":"